Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah! What a nice breeze!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NNami, if you don't mind,\NI'd like to stop the ship here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.70,0:02:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll just be for a moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.37,0:02:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop? What for?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.05,0:02:18.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a very important mission for Karoo.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.67,0:02:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo, I need you to go to Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and deliver this letter to my father.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.75,0:02:35.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It contains everything uncovered\Nby Igaram and myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.71,0:02:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for this country are in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, it lets him know
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.15,0:02:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that I've returned to\NAlabasta safe and sound
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.65,0:02:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and in the company\Nof brave friends
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.65,0:02:47.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,willing to help us\Nin our struggle.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.20,0:02:50.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, then. Can you do\Nthis for me, Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.14,0:02:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, be careful to conserve\Nyour water, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck! You can do it, Duck!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go let my father know, Karoo.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's hope for this\Nkingdom at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.35,0:03:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NI said "conserve,"\Nnot "consume"!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.87,0:03:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you. And good luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.25,0:03:24.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I did know that Crocodile\Nwas here in Alabasta...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but him trying to\Nsteal a kingdom?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.36,0:03:29.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a bad joke.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.43,0:03:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because why would a pirate\Ndrop anchor in one spot
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and settle down?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.06,0:03:35.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile trying to usurp\Nthe throne of Alabasta
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.50,0:03:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.27,0:03:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right! Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NYou know, there\Ncould be another side
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to this takeover thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.42,0:03:48.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like some sort of deeper goal or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWe're finally here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWow, so we're\Ngoing into the desert?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know how hot it's supposed to get?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOver a hundred\Ndegrees in the daytime!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.33,0:03:58.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat?! Please\Ntell me you're joking!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.52,0:04:01.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Nami, what happened?!\NWhere's your dancer outfit?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.97,0:04:05.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! You too?! Vivi,\Nwhy are you wearing that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because any exposed skin will get sunburned.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to cover up in the desert.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.29,0:04:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... those outfits...\Nwere so sexy...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.05,0:04:15.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NPut these on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh, thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.78,0:04:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NTime to drop anchor.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.01,0:04:19.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[splash]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.95,0:04:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYuba, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DUGONGS yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.87,0:04:42.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Turtles?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I think they're seals.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.07,0:04:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kung Fu Dugongs!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\N"If you wanna come ashore,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll have to beat me first,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.20,0:04:52.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I doubt that'll happen,\Nyou buncha cowards!"
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHa.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.51,0:04:58.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody calls me a coward\Nand gets away with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.55,0:04:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here comes the pain!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NUsopp! No, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.22,0:05:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kung Fu Dugongs\Nare really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSee! They're not too tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThat's bad too!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh? What the–
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.40,0:05:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's one of their rules.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.63,0:05:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they lose a kung fu match,\Nthey become the winner's pupil.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.30,0:05:23.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't say...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.24,0:05:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They think you're their master now!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.23,0:05:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Everyone, after me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.27,0:05:30.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.42,0:05:36.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Now... harder!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.19,0:05:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now... left!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.59,0:05:40.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Left! Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.76,0:05:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.11,0:05:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHope all you guys\Nenjoy the food! See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"All you guys." "Food."\NNow do you get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. They said they\Nwanted to go with us,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so why couldn't we let 'em?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.33,0:05:58.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough\Nfood and water
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to take care of\Na group that big!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.82,0:06:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't know\Nwhat we would've done
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if Chopper hadn't\Npersuaded them to stay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.79,0:06:06.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.94,0:06:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They kept saying, "Where you\Ngo, we'll follow, Master!"
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They really would have, too,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I hadn't given\Nthem that food!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.84,0:06:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAnd now our food supply's\Ngotten a lot smaller.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Luffy, thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.51,0:06:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a handful.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.51,0:06:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou're tellin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.19,0:06:30.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.89,0:06:33.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAre we in Yuba already?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.35,0:06:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. This is Erumalu.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.65,0:06:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was known far and wide\Nas the "City of Green."
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was green?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.85,0:06:44.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take a good look around, everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is what Baroque Works\Nhas been doing to my country.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.89,0:06:51.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people of Alabasta, this is\Nwhat they've had to go through.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.19,0:06:57.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWow! There's nothing\Nhere at all anymore, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:58.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NNo.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.39,0:07:00.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nothing but a ghost town now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.56,0:07:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But up until a few short years\Nago, it was a thriving city
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.43,0:07:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,full of gardens, palm trees,\Nand lush greenery.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis place? Hm.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NRain was always scarce here,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.77,0:07:14.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but by saving every last drop\Nof water and using it wisely,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the city was able to make\Nthe foliage flourish.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.84,0:07:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that stopped when the rain did.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a single drop\Nof water has fallen
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.78,0:07:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in any part of this country\Nfor three years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.97,0:07:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three years?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, that long?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.15,0:07:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But wait, even without rain,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there was still the river as another water source.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.58,0:07:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's close.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't they just pipe\Nthe water in from over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, the answer to that is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.95,0:07:44.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NEven though it's\Na desert kingdom,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.58,0:07:47.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,never in a thousands of years\Nof Alabasta's history
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.16,0:07:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has the rain ever\Nstopped completely.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.39,0:07:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, there was one place in the country
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.36,0:07:54.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where the rain fell more than\Nusual, much more in fact.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alubarna, the capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.27,0:08:00.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The city where the king's palace is located.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.99,0:08:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThe people of the land\Ncalled it the "King's Miracle."
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least, they did until\None particular day.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[SAILOR]\NGet that cargo unloaded!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got a schedule to keep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[STRIPED SHIRT]\NWe're losing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.20,0:08:39.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN I]\NWhat happened?!\NIs everyone all right?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it. What are we\Nsupposed to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a delivery for the king.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do when it doesn't arrive on time?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.24,0:08:52.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN J]\NThis green powder's\Nfor the king?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.18,0:08:53.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BILLIONS A]\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,How the hell should we know?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're only following your king's orders.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BILLIONS B]\NWe're just couriers!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.22,0:09:01.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.05,0:09:07.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN K]\NWait a minute. Could this be...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NDance Powder?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you've heard of it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.74,0:09:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure have. It summons rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A powder can?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI've only heard\Nstories about it,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but apparently, dance powder\Nwas created by a researcher
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in a country where\Nit never rained.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.22,0:09:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burning it creates a misty\Nsmoke which rises into the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once it reaches the clouds, it causes them to rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.66,0:09:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In essence, it gives\Nyou the ability
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.06,0:09:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to create rain on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, as its name suggests,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the country that developed dance powder
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was happy enough to dance.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.44,0:09:42.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It got lots of rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.87,0:09:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But there was a catch:
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its neighboring country had a drought.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me explain how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.64,0:09:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The mist from the\Nburned dance powder
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,targets small clouds that aren't ready to rain yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.37,0:09:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It artificially matures them into full rain clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those clouds would have naturally grown
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:00.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into rain clouds,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but when they were\Nfurther downwind...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOh, I get it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It steals all the rain that\Nwould've normally gone
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to a neighboring country!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.56,0:10:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That musta caused\Nsome big problems!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOh, it did.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A war broke out between the two countries.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.37,0:10:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ever since then,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.43,0:10:16.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the World Government has\Ninstituted a worldwide ban
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.47,0:10:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on the production and\Npossession of dance powder.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.25,0:10:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NEven so, some of it\Nmanaged to show up here, huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When it happened,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.00,0:10:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the country had been\Nexperiencing strange weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.33,0:10:28.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There had been no rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a single drop had fallen\Nanywhere except one place,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.87,0:10:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that was the capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.51,0:10:36.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}[CITIZEN L]\NNo wonder we haven't had\Nany rain in ages!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}The king stole it for the capital\Nusing this dance powder!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.76,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN M]\NSo Alubarna's rain\Nwasn't a miracle at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a sham!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.01,0:10:43.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3272,5232,\c&H090705&\3c&H090705&\4c&H090705&)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.07,0:10:45.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3272,5232,\c&H090705&\3c&H090705&\4c&H090705&)}[CITIZEN N]\NYeah! One that's left us parched and starving!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.72,0:10:47.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3272,5232,\c&H090705&\3c&H090705&\4c&H090705&)}This is all King Cobra's fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.57,0:10:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! That means your\Ndad is the bad guy here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You idiot! He was framed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:54.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOw! Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHer sweet dear old dad\Nwould never do such a thing,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.33,0:10:59.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course. My father didn't\Nhave anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was innocent.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.74,0:11:09.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, a large\Namount of dance powder
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was discovered inside his\Npalace shortly thereafter.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.89,0:11:13.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHuh.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.92,0:11:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They even had people working inside the palace.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.76,0:11:20.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSo... what is this? A road?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.90,0:11:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. It used to be a large canal.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.04,0:11:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It piped in fresh water\Nfrom the Sandora River.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.39,0:11:27.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until someone destroyed it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.98,0:11:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now do you see what happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With its canal gone,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.18,0:11:35.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the City of Green lost its only\Nremaining source of fresh water.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.55,0:11:38.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people here\Nwaited and prayed,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.22,0:11:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but sadly, rain never came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:42.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[clatter]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWow.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something like that\Nand the dance powder incident
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.53,0:11:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would really make people\Ndistrust their king.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.47,0:11:51.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat's exactly what\NCrocodile planned, I bet.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NWith no more water,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.74,0:11:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,fighting began to\Nbreak out in Erumalu.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To escape the violence here,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.58,0:12:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there was only one thing the exhausted citizens could do.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They abandoned the city
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.73,0:12:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and left for other oases\Nin search of water.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.73,0:12:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\Nthe City of\NGreen withered away.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.72,0:12:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone's collapsed!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.99,0:12:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean there are still\Npeople living in this city?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.65,0:12:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NWhat did my father...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and all of the\Nother good people...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did they ever do?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.85,0:12:38.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't deserve this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.85,0:12:40.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's hard enough to live in the desert.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.51,0:12:42.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every day, it's a struggle\Njust to survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.85,0:12:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somehow the people of Alabasta\Nfound a way to do it
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they led happy lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.49,0:12:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Crocodile\Ndestroyed those lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gives him the right\Nto do that?! What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the while, as one of the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.38,0:12:58.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he passes himself off\Nas a hero of the people!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't know what\Nhe's really doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.66,0:13:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one realizes that\Nhe's actually deceiving
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.80,0:13:05.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,the entire country,\Neven as they cheer him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CROWD]\N– Crocodile! Crocodile!\N– Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Crocodile! Crocodile!\N– Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.48,0:13:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't! I can't let\Nhim get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.22,0:13:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, well... Hope that\Nmade him feel better.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NVivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.27,0:13:41.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get movin', 'kay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm itchin' to do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.44,0:13:48.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe's right. Let's get to Yuba.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.48,0:13:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where the rebel\Narmy is, right? Yuba?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have to stop them.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to persuade their leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.97,0:13:56.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the rebel\Nleader the truth,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that all of this is\NCrocodile's doing,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.27,0:14:04.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and have him stop all of\Nthis pointless bloodshed.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.67,0:14:06.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm burning up.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.56,0:14:32.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think can't\Neven sweat anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.00,0:14:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you please spare us the melodramatics, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're only gonna\Nwear yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.17,0:14:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gee, I guess he's not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't go on.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't take hot weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.51,0:14:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine in cold weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's because of all that fur.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.82,0:14:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take off that stupid reindeer costume?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.23,0:14:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you just say\Nto me, big nose?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.23,0:14:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of reindeer!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.25,0:15:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.81,0:15:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't turn yourself big,\Nor I'm gonna quit pulling you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.52,0:15:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you callin' a monster,\Nyou bird-nosed freak?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.26,0:15:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better take it easy on\Nthe nose, or I'll have to get tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.80,0:15:13.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Turn small, will ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.09,0:15:20.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, the desert doesn't seem to bother you much, Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I was born and raised in this country,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.50,0:15:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I guess you could say I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.07,0:15:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo... what's\Nwith all these hills?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.37,0:15:32.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was expecting a desert\Nto be more flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:33.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUgh!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.61,0:15:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThis is a very old desert.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.46,0:15:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some of the sand dunes here are over 900 feet high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:40.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nine hundred feet? Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:45.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. That's... Ugh.\NThat's a mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.12,0:15:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo hot. Water.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.52,0:15:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NJust one drink, Luffy.\NJust one mouthful.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.80,0:15:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't drink so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.97,0:15:56.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! You'd better save some\Nof that water for Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.74,0:15:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! You just had some!\NI'm next! Gimme...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.88,0:16:02.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're only going to\Nwear yourselves out
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you keep it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.41,0:16:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, she started it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.42,0:16:07.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's always his fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.78,0:16:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.65,0:16:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's have one of\Nthose box lunches!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNot yet. Not until Vivi says so.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.45,0:16:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vivi, how 'bout it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.89,0:16:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's eat! Doesn't\Nthat sound good?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.09,0:16:23.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we're not even a tenth\Nof the way to Yuba, Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we have to make our\Nsupplies last the whole way.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.96,0:16:29.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Vivi. Haven't\Nyou heard the old proverb?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Make sure you eat\Nwhenever you're hungry!"
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.63,0:16:34.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit makin' things\Nup, you big fat liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.00,0:16:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you're that hungry,\NI'll tell you what,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the next group\Nof rocks we come to?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.71,0:16:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, rocks it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.21,0:16:42.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onward to the next group of rocks!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.65,0:16:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay, guys, whoever wins\Nat rock-paper-scissors
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.68,0:16:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has to carry everybody's stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NQuit deciding things!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And ready... go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.33,0:16:51.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rock! Paper! Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWait!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNow just hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.17,0:16:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey! You started late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI win!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIdiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHeavy... So heavy...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhy am I doin' all the work?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.45,0:17:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou said the winner carries all.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.28,0:17:11.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now shut up and haul.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.25,0:17:13.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMake sure you don't drop anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! I spotted\Nrocks, dead ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.61,0:17:23.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.05,0:17:26.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's lunchtime! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.39,0:17:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NShade! It feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.00,0:17:58.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.47,0:17:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThat's weird.\NWhy is he coming back?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.67,0:18:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a whole flock\Nof injured birds here that can't move!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor! Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.25,0:18:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right! Let's go, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NComing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.62,0:18:11.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWe gotta help those birds!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.59,0:18:12.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What birds?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.42,0:18:13.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,those birds might not be\Nwhat you think they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.40,0:18:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAll of our stuff is gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe've been had!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I saw them!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.11,0:18:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was a whole flock of dying birds lying right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.71,0:18:33.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I should've\Nmentioned this earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Warusagi birds are desert\Nbandits that deceive travelers
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and steal their belongings.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.72,0:18:41.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.89,0:18:46.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean these birds play dead?\NWhat a lousy buncha crooks!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThis is all my fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.63,0:18:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those birds tricked me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.66,0:18:52.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you dolt, is that all\Nyou have to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.47,0:18:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There were three days' worth\Nof supplies in those packs,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you just had to go and\Nlet a bunch of stupid birds
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.14,0:18:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,rob us blind in the\Nmiddle of a desert!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Nget across this wasteland
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without food or water?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you're proud of yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.11,0:19:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's not my fault.\NI mean, they outsmarted me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean you're dumber than a bird?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNo, you're not that smart!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just save your energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.15,0:19:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's better\Njust to let them have it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou're just a moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.33,0:19:25.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's just take a break.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.55,0:19:29.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This heat is just startin' to\Nwear on everybody's nerves.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.35,0:19:31.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll manage\Nfood- and water-wise.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nothin' that'll\Nkill us right away.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.34,0:19:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's put it out of\Nour minds for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good idea,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because when I think about it, I get really thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:41.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NMh-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cawing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]\N[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give us our stuff\Nback, you thieves!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy! Don't chase them!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWait! Will you be\Nable to find your way back?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.68,0:20:06.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGet back here, you dope! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.58,0:20:12.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NStop! You can't\Nget away from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.09,0:20:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGet back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.33,0:20:26.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy. Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.36,0:20:29.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, you don't suppose he could be lost, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there are still so\Nmany desert dangers
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chance to warn him about yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.27,0:20:45.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.78,0:20:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIs it another sandstorm?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.84,0:20:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait. That looks like–
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.85,0:21:02.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.05,0:21:05.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.18,0:21:07.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.35,0:21:09.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why is he on a camel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone wanna tell me what\Nthe hell's chasing him?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't really tell,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it looks like there's\Nsomething in the sand
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.36,0:21:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,burrowing after him!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.82,0:21:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a Sandora Dragon!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.63,0:21:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's a what?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.36,0:21:30.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NA Sandora Dragon!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.03,0:21:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're the biggest reptile\Nthat lives in the desert!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.37,0:21:33.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They wait under the\Nsand for their prey,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then ambush them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.27,0:21:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have razor-sharp fangs and claws,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but they hardly ever use them.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because they're so incredibly huge,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they usually just end up\Nswallowing their victims whole!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.92,0:21:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, that boy\Ndoes have a talent
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.12,0:21:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for attracting trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.89,0:21:50.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, and all of us have the scars to prove it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kinda crap star\Nwas he born under
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.19,0:21:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to attract trouble like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.12,0:21:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NStop, camel,\Nyou're going too fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.89,0:22:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIs he too much for you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe'll lend a hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.36,0:22:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys! I brought home\Na little somethin' for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:05.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\N– Tatsu...\N[SANJI]\N– Epaule...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:08.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\N– Whip!\N[ZORO]\N– Maki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NShoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:15.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.85,0:22:19.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to go that far!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whenever those guys fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.18,0:22:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it almost makes me\Nfeel sorry for the monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.56,0:22:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is convenient.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.66,0:22:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These rocks are just like a natural frying pan.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.80,0:22:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSo, now that we have a moment,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.57,0:22:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what's the deal with the camel?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.47,0:22:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was gettin' eaten\Nby the mystery plants
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.50,0:22:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while I was chasin' those birds.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.24,0:22:46.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's obviously not a wild camel.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.21,0:22:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NNo, not with\Na saddle and bridle.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a passenger-carrying camel?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.25,0:22:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's sure gonna\Nmake things lots easier!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.69,0:22:56.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that oughtta\Nbe a real help.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.36,0:22:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like he could carry two.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.06,0:23:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Camels do go hand-in-hand\Nwith deserts.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.88,0:23:03.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great, I'll take\Nthe first shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:05.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOw!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.85,0:23:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"I'm a freedom-loving,\Nhard-boiled, yet compassionate,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.18,0:23:09.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,son of the desert!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.15,0:23:10.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm very grateful to you\Nfor having helped me
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.98,0:23:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,outta that jam back there,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.18,0:23:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'll be glad to give\Nsome of you a ride,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.99,0:23:16.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid I don't accept\Nmale passengers!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.36,0:23:18.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYeah, at least\Ngive Chopper a ride!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.94,0:23:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\N"I'm too macho!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.25,0:23:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhy, you! Why, I oughtta\Npunch you in the nu–
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.12,0:23:27.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI'm so sorry that my crewmates
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.86,0:23:29.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are a bunch of ill-bred louts!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.46,0:23:31.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, what should we call you,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.09,0:23:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you great big\Nprecious camel, you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.86,0:23:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIdiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.36,0:23:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NMoron!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.06,0:23:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDoofus!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Eyelash" it is, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NUh, how'd you arrive at that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.54,0:23:41.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay! Climb on, Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.51,0:23:44.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine. I can\Nstill walk. Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.25,0:23:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just get on.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.82,0:23:46.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NPervert camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:50.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP, SANJI, LUFFY]\N– Pervert camel! Pervert camel!\N– Pervert camel! Pervert camel!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.82,0:23:51.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.79,0:23:53.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should be able to make better time now!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.37,0:23:55.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to get to Yuba as fast as we can
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.37,0:23:58.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so we'll be able to talk to the rebel army.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Giddyup, Eyelash!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.79,0:24:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Hey, wait for us!\N– Hey, wait for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.75,0:24:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHurry up, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.98,0:24:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you get separated, you'll never leave the desert alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.85,0:24:07.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWell, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.81,0:24:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI like this side of Nami too!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.48,0:24:10.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat else is new?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.58,0:24:11.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NAfter them! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.82,0:24:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NChopper! Hop on!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.38,0:24:12.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRight!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.98,0:24:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOYS]\N– Wait for us!\N– Wait for us!
